# Starring a task in the outline pane adds it, in document order, to a Starred view open in a second pane.
file <<END
Inbox stuff:
	- Call mom @star
	- Pay bill
Work:
	- Report @star
END
keys <C-g>
type starred
keys <C-t>
see │▌ - Call mom
keys <C-w> h j j *
see - Pay bill 󰓎  Inbox stuff
quit
saved <<END
Inbox stuff:
	- Call mom @star
	- Pay bill @star
Work:
	- Report @star
END
